---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
---
<Layout title="CPR, First Aid & Emergency Preparedness Training" description="Instructor-led CPR, AED, First Aid, BLS, FAST, and preparedness training inquiries for individuals and groups in Washington State.">
  <p class="lead">Practical training for people who may need to act before help arrives.</p>
  <p>I offer instructor-led emergency response and preparedness education for individuals, employees, businesses, community organizations, and public safety personnel. Ask about American Red Cross training and group sessions throughout Washington State.</p>
  <a class="button" href="#request">Request Training</a>
  <div class="offering-grid">
    <section><h2>CPR &amp; AED</h2><p>Recognizing cardiac emergencies, providing CPR, and using an automated external defibrillator. Discuss the adult, child, or infant coverage appropriate to your needs.</p></section>
    <section><h2>First Aid</h2><p>Recognizing and responding to common injuries and sudden illnesses. Useful for workplaces, community groups, and everyday preparedness.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Basic Life Support (BLS)</h2><p>Resuscitation training for healthcare and public safety personnel. Tell me what your employer or professional role requires so we can identify the appropriate course.</p></section>
    <section><h2>First Aid for Severe Trauma (FAST)</h2><p>Training focused on responding to life-threatening bleeding and severe trauma. Ask about course availability, audience suitability, and requirements.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Preparedness &amp; workplace response</h2><p>Emergency preparedness workshops, workplace safety and response education, emergency communications, evacuation and shelter-in-place familiarization, and family disaster readiness.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Group &amp; organizational training</h2><p>Discuss participant numbers, your training location, scheduling needs, and the skills your group needs to practice. Course format and logistics are agreed before booking.</p></section>
  </div>
  <h2>Course information &amp; certification</h2>
  <p>Certificates are issued when applicable course requirements are successfully completed. Attendance alone does not guarantee certification. Required online work, hands-on skills, assessments, prerequisites, and certificate terms depend on the selected course and will be explained before enrollment.</p>
  <p>Confirm any employer or licensing requirement before choosing a course. I will confirm my current authorization for the requested American Red Cross course, along with its format and availability, before accepting a booking. Additional Red Cross courses may be discussed; specialized courses are not promised without that confirmation.</p>
  <p><a href="https://www.redcross.org/take-a-class/cpr/cpr-training/cpr-certification">American Red Cross CPR certification information</a> · <a href="https://www.redcross.org/take-a-class/bls-training/bls-certification">BLS certification information</a></p>
  <InquiryForm type="training" />
  <p class="service-disclaimer">Training is offered independently. No endorsement by my employers, public agencies, or volunteer organizations is implied. Course dates, pricing, and availability are confirmed individually.</p>
  <p>Need an emergency operations plan or organizational assessment? <a href="/consulting/">Explore Consulting Services.</a></p>
</Layout>
